{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! All three obligations are VERIFIED:\n- The calculated metric: 2.3243 per 100,000 residents (rounded from 2.324269152743651)\n- Total farmers markets: 7,944\n- Total US population: 341,784,857\n\nThe witnesses are persisted as verify-markets_per_100k, verify-total_farmers_markets, and verify-total_population.\n\nNow let me also verify the lineage to make sure both sources are properly referenced.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_014Hcq343yK2kdDTzTTG34ef","name":"xorq_check_lineage","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","alias":"markets_per_100k","no_local":true}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":225,"cacheRead":19157,"cacheWrite":784,"totalTokens":20178,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.0011250000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0019157000000000002,"cacheWrite":0.00098,"total":0.0040327},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":116},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786914745272,"responseId":"msg_011Ce77hpLowZKWE7bi4NGTD","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_014Hcq343yK2kdDTzTTG34ef","toolName":"xorq_check_lineage","content":[{"type":"text","text":" ✅ VERIFIED   lineage · markets_per_100k  ·  2 sources\n   ✓ lineage reaches a source from its root\n   ✓ read_csv(https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv)  via pandas\n   ✓ read_csv(https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv)  via pandas"}],"details":{"alias":"markets_per_100k","sources":[{"node":"@read_3f612b18e608","op":"Read","method":"read_csv","path":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv","table":"farmers_markets","profile":"beee580ceeacddc83bd6914e17f47319_0","con_name":"pandas","snapshot_hash":"3f612b18e608f1c1c2bf62ee0a528e47"},{"node":"@read_2ecedec8ecd4"